  "display_title": "Like You've Never Been Hurt",
  "description": "Does love really last forever? \n\nCollege student Izzy Noh thinks her loving relationship with her boyfriend Minsu will last forever… until he cheats on her. To make things worse, they are not only in the same school, but in the same Game Developer Club. Izzy must now navigate handling the breakup, dealing with her feelings, and possibly opening up to another shot at love. Will Izzy and her friends from the Game Developer Club find true campus love? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
